  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味と　酸味が　強い　調味料。特に　フルーツ類と　相性が　よくサンドウィッチにも　使いやすいのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛과 신맛이 강한 조미료. 특히 과일 종류와 궁합이 잘 맞는다. 샌드위치에도 사용하기 좋다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味和酸味強勁的調味料。和水果類特別搭配。作為三明治的食材也很好使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très sucré et acide. Facile à incorporer dans un Sandwich, il accompagne particulièrement bien les fruits.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Würzmittel vereint sehr süße wie saure Geschmacksnoten. Es harmoniert perfekt mit Obst und lässt sich auch gut auf Sandwiches streichen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este ingrediente de sabor agridulce combina a la perfección con todo tipo de frutas y es muy fácil de incorporar en los bocadillos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento molto dolce e aspro. Si abbina particolarmente bene alla frutta e si può usare con facilità anche nei panini.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment that’s very sweet and very sour. It goes especially well with fruit and is easy to incorporate into a sandwich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甘味と　酸味が　強い　調味料。特に　フルーツ類と　相性が　よくサンドウィッチにも　使いやすいのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
